<title>CANADA: Royal Bank says Q3 loan loss provision flat.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank says Q3 loan loss provision flat.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Bank of Canada said on Thursday that its provision for credit losses was C$110 million in the third quarter ended July 31, unchanged from the previous second quarter.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement its provision for credit losses was down C$30 million, or 21 percent, from the third quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>The bank's general provision remained at C$300 million in the third quarter.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
